5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm not letting any wolf get away with anything. Does anyone have a plan, or should we just start talking?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us begin with kindness and patience. A calm heart often sees the truth more clearly.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help. I think we should just get to know each other first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with a cautious approach. We have no data yet, so observing behavioral patterns is the only logical starting point.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will be observing as well. Reason must prevail over intuition in a game of deception. I'll keep my thoughts to myself for a moment.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, you're always so cold! We can't just ""observe"" forever. We need to be brave and find the wolf before they eat us!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Now, now, Takumi. Bravery is a virtue, but it must be tempered with wisdom. Let us listen to what others have to say.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think Takumi's energy is wonderful, but maybe we can find a balance? I'd like to hear if anyone has a specific way they spot lies.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I look for contradictions. A lie is a fragile thing; it only takes one inconsistency to break the entire narrative.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. I'll be analyzing the flow of the conversation. If someone tries to steer the group too aggressively, it may be a red flag.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not steering anything! I just want to win! @Ryuji, you're being way too quiet. That's almost suspicious already!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us not cast stones so early, young Takumi. Silence can be a sign of deep thought, not necessarily a hidden agenda.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. Let's give everyone a chance to speak. I'm curious if the Seer wants to stay hidden or reveal themselves.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Revealing the Seer on Day 0 is tactical suicide. The wolf would simply eliminate them tonight. It is better to remain a secret.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I concur with Toshio. The Seer's survival is the village's greatest asset. We should protect that identity at all costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, we'll wait. But I'm watching all of you! I'll find the wolf even if I have to do it the hard way.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Servas,,That spirit is admirable. I shall wish you all a peaceful night. May the truth guide us tomorrow.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we all sleep well and wake up safe. I'm looking forward to seeing what happens.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I have seen enough for today. I will process these initial impressions tonight.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,A sensible conclusion. I shall retire and reflect on our discourse.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
