35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up! I'm the Seer, and I've already found the wolf! Midori is the werewolf! We should vote her out right now!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"My goodness, such a bold revelation so early! Takumi, are you certain you wish to expose yourself this way?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What?! Takumi, that's not true! I'm just a villager! Why would you lie about me? I'm so shocked...","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"This is an unexpected development. Either Takumi is the Seer and we've won instantly, or he's the wolf attempting a preemptive strike.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,A claim this early is highly aggressive. It forces the village to choose between two narratives immediately. It is a risky gambit.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not lying! I saw it with my own eyes! @Midori, stop acting all innocent, it's not working on me!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Midori has always seemed so gentle. It is hard to imagine her as a predator, but the truth is often hidden behind a smile.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, please believe me! I don't know why Takumi is doing this. I'm just a normal person! I'm really scared now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, if you are the wolf, claiming the Seer role and targeting a quiet player like Midori is a classic strategy to gain trust.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I find Takumi's certainty interesting. However, the lack of a counter-claim from another Seer makes his position stronger, logically speaking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"See? Even Ryuji thinks I'm right! @Toshio, stop trying to protect the wolf just because you like ""logic""!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us breathe. If Takumi is telling the truth, the danger is gone. If he is lying, we are executing an innocent soul.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I can't believe this is happening. I've been nothing but kind to everyone! Please, don't listen to him!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The probability of Takumi being the Seer is high given the timing, but the risk of a ""wolf-seer"" is too great to ignore.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I will weigh the evidence. Midori's reaction is emotional, which is expected, but Takumi's aggression is his defining trait.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm done talking! Midori is the wolf! Let's just vote and end this game right now!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I trust the bravery of the young. If he is willing to risk his life by revealing himself, I shall support him.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Midori,,"This is a nightmare... please, someone help me...","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will follow the most likely lead, though I remain skeptical of the aggression.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
